<section class="section bg-dark" id="founding">
  <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="width:400px;height:400px;top:-80px;right:-80px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(224,113,44,.12),transparent 60%)"></div>
  <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="width:300px;height:300px;bottom:-60px;left:-40px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,171,189,.15),transparent 60%)"></div>
  <div class="section-inner centered">
    <span class="script script-hero" style="color:var(--accent-light)">Limited Availability</span>
    <h2 class="headline" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">Be one of the first.</h2>
    <p class="subhead" style="max-width:600px">We're opening The Center Book to a small group of Kumon centers who want to be first. Early partners work with us directly: we build your site and load your data for you, and lock in preferred pricing from day one.</p>
    <div class="founding-benefits">
      <div class="founding-benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f5a06a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Lock in your rate</h3>
        <p>Early partners get a lower monthly rate that stays locked in, even as the platform grows and the price goes up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founding-benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f5a06a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="5 9 2 12 5 15"/><polyline points="9 5 12 2 15 5"/><polyline points="15 19 12 22 9 19"/><polyline points="19 9 22 12 19 15"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Shape the platform</h3>
        <p>Your feedback directly influences what gets built next. You're not just a user. You're a partner building what your center needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founding-benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f5a06a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>The full platform from day one</h3>
        <p>Operations, communication, scheduling, analytics, website, portal, and email. All built. All included. One system.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-white" data-cta="Get Started">Get Started</a>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost-light" data-cta="Book a Demo">Book a Demo</a>
    </div>
    <p class="founding-fineprint">Limited spots. Each center gets a dedicated installation built from the ground up.</p>
  </div>
</section>
